  m_Name: ArcadeGameTandavaSevering
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 70
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: 'Tandava: Severing'
  Description: 'The hunt from Tandava, and a creature that fights back. Cut clean through its body and
    the piece crawls off as the Severed, a second serpent that feeds and races home to
    rejoin it. It remembers every wound, and the play that hurt it once works less the next
    time. On its way up to the dance it tears between a whale and a jelly. Shatter it or
    break its halo before its last feast. Everyone flies together.'
